name    mod-kill-collector: an earned achievement raises the damage against that creature type by 5%
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Needs KillCollector.Enable = 1, KillCollector.AchievementsEnable = 1
# (to earn the achievement) and KillCollector.DamageBonusPct = 5 (the default), the module's achievement_dbc rows on
# the server and this folder in TestBots.ScenarioDirs.
#
# The proof is the combat log, not a health comparison: the Enchanted Zol'maz weapon is level 77-80, drawn at every
# spawn, so two of them differ in maximum health (11379-12600) and armor. The bot casts spell 66595 ("dmg5 arcane"),
# a SCHOOL_DAMAGE spell of 5000 fixed damage: no random roll (DieSides 1), cannot crit (SPELL_ATTR2_CANT_CRIT), no
# hit roll (DmgClass NONE), arcane so no armor, ignores the caster's damage modifiers and the target's, and the
# creatures here have no resistance - so the damage the bot's own combat log shows is exactly 5000, and 5250 with the
# +5% (`spelllog` reads SMSG_SPELLNONMELEEDAMAGELOG, i.e. the damage after the module's hook). The cast is triggered:
# no range, mana or learned spell needed.
#
# 1. The bot (a warlock, slot 2 = Tblocb on TBOT02) starts clean: `.reset achievements` (a game master command, the
#    director's) deletes every achievement of that character, so the scenario can run again; `.killcollector reset`
#    empties its collection. `.killcollector status` rereads the earned achievements into the damage bonus ("Damage
#    bonus: none").
# 2. A first Enchanted Zol'maz weapon (86156, creature type 10 = "Oddities") takes 5000.
# 3. The director kills the three creatures of "Oddities of the Forgotten Land" (30050) while the bot stands next to
#    them in the party, as kill_collector_achievement does.
# 4. A second Zol'maz weapon takes 5250 - the same spell, the bonus of the earned achievement.
# 5. Beyond the continent the achievement belongs to, and only for its creature type: an Enchanted Tiki Warrior (28882,
#    type 10, Zul'Drak in Northrend) takes 5250, an Enraged Mammoth (28851, a beast) next to it takes 5000.
#
# The character must not hold a type 10 achievement when the run starts; step 1 sees to that. If `.reset
# achievements` is not allowed for the director, pick another character: `slot=3` is Tblocc, `slot=4` Tblocd (every
# slot has its own warlock "Tbloc<letter>"); the name in step 1 follows the slot.
timeout 300s

bot b warlock slot=2
group party

log 1 - a clean start
place 727 12286.3 11701.4 -83.7
require b alive
do gm target b
as gm .killcollector reset
expect output has "collection reset"
as gm .reset achievements Tblocb
as b .killcollector status
expect output has "Damage bonus: none"
expect output has "N3rd: not yet (0 of 45 achievements)"

log 2 - without the achievement the spell does 5000
pick w1 creature:86156 near b
do gm target w1
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick w1 creature:86156 near b
require w1 alive
do b approach w1
wait 1s
spelllog start
do b cast 66595 on w1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect b spell 66595 casts == 1
expect b spell 66595 damage == 5000
expect w1 health < 100%

log 3 - complete Oddities of the Forgotten Land (Poisonous Mushroom, Void Stone, Enchanted Zol'maz weapon)
place 727 13392.6 11411.4 -148.5
pick m creature:30435 near b
do gm target m
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick m creature:30435 near b
require m alive
do b approach m
wait 1s
do gm target m
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor m dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

place 727 13711.4 11947.7 -49
pick v creature:86123 near b
do gm target v
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick v creature:86123 near b
require v alive
do b approach v
wait 1s
do gm target v
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor v dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

place 727 12044.3 11658.8 -85.3
pick k creature:86156 near b
do gm target k
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick k creature:86156 near b
require k alive
do b approach k
wait 1s
do gm target k
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor k dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
as b .killcollector status
expect output has "3 different creatures killed"
expect output has "1 of 9 achievements"
expect output has "Damage bonus: +5% oddities"
expect output has "N3rd: not yet (1 of 45 achievements)"

log 4 - with the achievement the same spell does 5250 (a second, untouched weapon)
place 727 12215.6 11687.8 -84.2
pick w2 creature:86156 near b
do gm target w2
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick w2 creature:86156 near b
require w2 alive
do b approach w2
wait 1s
spelllog start
do b cast 66595 on w2 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect b spell 66595 casts == 1
expect b spell 66595 damage == 5250
expect w2 health < 100%

log 5 - the bonus follows the creature type, not the continent
place 571 6497.08 -4105.45 469.054
pick t creature:28882 near b
do gm target t
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick t creature:28882 near b
require t alive
do b approach t
wait 1s
spelllog start
do b cast 66595 on t triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect b spell 66595 damage == 5250

place 571 6340.85 -4148.84 458.931
pick e creature:28851 near b
do gm target e
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick e creature:28851 near b
require e alive
do b approach e
wait 1s
spelllog start
do b cast 66595 on e triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect b spell 66595 damage == 5000

cleanup
log kill collector bonus done
